{
 "rpg.onboard.w01.en": "The world was once whole.",
 "rpg.onboard.w01.en_full": "The world was once whole.",
 "rpg.onboard.w01.zh": "世界曾经完整。",
 "rpg.onboard.w02.en": "God set down His Authority: Authority to",
 "rpg.onboard.w02.en_2": "name what is true, and Might to make it so.",
 "rpg.onboard.w02.en_full": "God set down His Authority: Authority to name what is true, and Might to make it so.",
 "rpg.onboard.w02.zh": "神立定权柄：权，命名何为真实；力，使真实显现。",
 "rpg.onboard.w03.en": "The Morning Star would not bow, and there was war in",
 "rpg.onboard.w03.en_2": "heaven. A third of the stars fell, and became devils.",
 "rpg.onboard.w03.en_full": "The Morning Star would not bow, and there was war in heaven. A third of the stars fell, and became devils.",
 "rpg.onboard.w03.zh": "晨星不肯屈膝，天上就有了争战。三分之一的星辰坠落，成了恶魔。",
 "rpg.onboard.w04.en": "Satan was bound in the bottomless pit, and sealed for a thousand years.",
 "rpg.onboard.w04.en_full": "Satan was bound in the bottomless pit, and sealed for a thousand years.",
 "rpg.onboard.w04.zh": "撒旦被锁进无底坑，封印一千年。",
 "rpg.onboard.w05.en": "King Solomon made a covenant with the",
 "rpg.onboard.w05.en_2": "seventy-two, and bound them in seventy-two pillars.",
 "rpg.onboard.w05.en_full": "King Solomon made a covenant with the seventy-two, and bound them in seventy-two pillars.",
 "rpg.onboard.w05.zh": "所罗门王与七十二魔神立约，把它们封进七十二根柱中。",
 "rpg.onboard.w06.en": "In later days the Church made those pillars an armoury,",
 "rpg.onboard.w06.en_2": "and those who bore the covenants were called Edgewalkers.",
 "rpg.onboard.w06.en_full": "In later days the Church made those pillars an armoury, and those who bore the covenants were called Edgewalkers.",
 "rpg.onboard.w06.zh": "后来，教廷把这些柱子当作军械库；与魔神立约的人，被称为边缘者。",
 "rpg.onboard.w07.en": "A hundred years of war scorched the land, and",
 "rpg.onboard.w07.en_2": "the Hollow walked the cities like empty houses.",
 "rpg.onboard.w07.en_full": "A hundred years of war scorched the land, and the Hollow walked the cities like empty houses.",
 "rpg.onboard.w07.zh": "百年战争烧焦了大地；空缺者在城中行走，像没有人住的空屋。",
 "rpg.onboard.w08.en": "And now, the thousand years are nearly done.",
 "rpg.onboard.w08.en_full": "And now, the thousand years are nearly done.",
 "rpg.onboard.w08.zh": "如今，那一千年快要完了。",
 "rpg.onboard.w09.en": "Gods fell, angels fell, and Authority was torn",
 "rpg.onboard.w09.en_2": "apart; the world broke into the land beneath your feet.",
 "rpg.onboard.w09.en_full": "Gods fell, angels fell, and Authority was torn apart; the world broke into the land beneath your feet.",
 "rpg.onboard.w09.zh": "神陨、堕天、权柄分裂之后，世界碎成了你脚下的这片大陆。",
 "rpg.onboard.w10.en": "Eretz Ha-Shevarim, the Shattered Land. Here, you wake.",
 "rpg.onboard.w10.en_full": "Eretz Ha-Shevarim, the Shattered Land. Here, you wake.",
 "rpg.onboard.w10.zh": "破碎大陆。你从这里醒来。",
 "rpg.prologue.D01.en": "He would have us kneel to one who has not yet come. I will not kneel.",
 "rpg.prologue.D01.en_full": "He would have us kneel to one who has not yet come. I will not kneel.",
 "rpg.prologue.D01.zh": "他要我们跪一个还没来的人。我不跪。",
 "rpg.prologue.D02.en": "Michael is just ahead.",
 "rpg.prologue.D02.en_full": "Michael is just ahead.",
 "rpg.prologue.D02.zh": "米迦勒就在前面。",
 "rpg.prologue.D03.en": "Then we walk over him.",
 "rpg.prologue.D03.en_full": "Then we walk over him.",
 "rpg.prologue.D03.zh": "那就从他身上踏过去。",
 "rpg.prologue.D04.en": "And when we've won — whose is Heaven?",
 "rpg.prologue.D04.en_full": "And when we've won — whose is Heaven?",
 "rpg.prologue.D04.zh": "赢了以后，天上归谁？",
 "rpg.prologue.D05.en": "Ours.",
 "rpg.prologue.D05.en_full": "Ours.",
 "rpg.prologue.D05.zh": "归我们。",
 "rpg.prologue.D06.en": "The treasuries too. Remember you said it.",
 "rpg.prologue.D06.en_full": "The treasuries too. Remember you said it.",
 "rpg.prologue.D06.zh": "宝库也算在里面。记住你说的。",
 "rpg.prologue.E01.en": "This fight is more than I can swallow.",
 "rpg.prologue.E01.en_full": "This fight is more than I can swallow.",
 "rpg.prologue.E01.zh": "这一仗，吃不下了。",
 "rpg.prologue.E02.en": "There's nothing in Heaven worth dying for.",
 "rpg.prologue.E02.en_full": "There's nothing in Heaven worth dying for.",
 "rpg.prologue.E02.zh": "天上没有值得我死的东西。",
 "rpg.prologue.E03.en": "I don't make losing trades.",
 "rpg.prologue.E03.en_full": "I don't make losing trades.",
 "rpg.prologue.E03.zh": "赔本的买卖，我不做。",
 "rpg.prologue.L01.en": "Scatter!",
 "rpg.prologue.L01.en_full": "Scatter!",
 "rpg.prologue.L01.zh": "散开！",
 "rpg.prologue.M01.en": "Who is like God!",
 "rpg.prologue.M01.en_full": "Who is like God!",
 "rpg.prologue.M01.zh": "谁似神！",
 "rpg.prologue.M02.en": "Lucifer — thou sealest up the sum, full of wisdom, and perfect in beauty.",
 "rpg.prologue.M02.en_full": "Lucifer — thou sealest up the sum, full of wisdom, and perfect in beauty.",
 "rpg.prologue.M02.zh": "路西法，你本是无所不备的，智慧充足，全然美丽。",
 "rpg.prologue.M03.en": "The Lord rebuke thee.",
 "rpg.prologue.M03.en_full": "The Lord rebuke thee.",
 "rpg.prologue.M03.zh": "主责备你吧。",
 "rpg.prologue.M04.en": "Thine heart was lifted up because of thy beauty.",
 "rpg.prologue.M04.en_full": "Thine heart was lifted up because of thy beauty.",
 "rpg.prologue.M04.zh": "你因美丽心中高傲。",
 "rpg.prologue.N01.en": "In the beginning God created the heaven and the",
 "rpg.prologue.N01.en_2": "earth, and the angels to stand before His throne.",
 "rpg.prologue.N01.en_full": "In the beginning God created the heaven and the earth, and the angels to stand before His throne.",
 "rpg.prologue.N01.zh": "起初，神造天地，又造众天使侍立在宝座前。",
 "rpg.prologue.N02.en": "Among them was one brighter than all the rest, named",
 "rpg.prologue.N02.en_2": "Lucifer, the son of the morning. God gave him both",
 "rpg.prologue.N02.en_3": "Authority and Might, and set him above all the angels.",
 "rpg.prologue.N02.en_full": "Among them was one brighter than all the rest, named Lucifer, the son of the morning. God gave him both Authority and Might, and set him above all the angels.",
 "rpg.prologue.N02.zh": "众天使之中有一位最明亮的，名叫路西法，就是早晨之子。神将权与力都赐给他，使他在众天使之上。",
 "rpg.prologue.N03.en": "Then God said: A Son shall come, and every angel shall bow the knee to Him.",
 "rpg.prologue.N03.en_full": "Then God said: A Son shall come, and every angel shall bow the knee to Him.",
 "rpg.prologue.N03.zh": "那时神说：将来必有一位子要来，众天使都当向他屈膝。",
 "rpg.prologue.N04.en": "And Lucifer said in his heart: I will ascend into",
 "rpg.prologue.N04.en_2": "heaven, I will exalt my throne above the stars of God.",
 "rpg.prologue.N04.en_full": "And Lucifer said in his heart: I will ascend into heaven, I will exalt my throne above the stars of God.",
 "rpg.prologue.N04.zh": "路西法心里说：我要升到天上，我要高举我的宝座，在神众星以上。",
 "rpg.prologue.N05.en": "And they gathered together into a place",
 "rpg.prologue.N05.en_2": "called in the Hebrew tongue Armageddon.",
 "rpg.prologue.N05.en_full": "And they gathered together into a place called in the Hebrew tongue Armageddon.",
 "rpg.prologue.N05.zh": "于是他们聚集在一处，希伯来话叫作哈米吉多顿。",
 "rpg.prologue.N06.en": "When that foot came down, Lucifer's mind left his body — and that mind was",
 "rpg.prologue.N06.en_2": "his Authority. It became a thread of green smoke and fled into the closing rift.",
 "rpg.prologue.N06.en_full": "When that foot came down, Lucifer's mind left his body — and that mind was his Authority. It became a thread of green smoke and fled into the closing rift.",
 "rpg.prologue.N06.zh": "那一脚落下的时候，路西法的意识离了身体，就是他的权。它化作一缕绿色的烟，遁入那将要合上的裂缝。",
 "rpg.prologue.N07.en": "The body left in the pit, and his Might with",
 "rpg.prologue.N07.en_2": "it, passed to the one who stands against God.",
 "rpg.prologue.N07.en_full": "The body left in the pit, and his Might with it, passed to the one who stands against God.",
 "rpg.prologue.N07.zh": "留在坑里的身体，连同他的力，归了那与神对立的。",
 "rpg.prologue.N08.en": "So Satan sank into the bottomless pit.",
 "rpg.prologue.N08.en_full": "So Satan sank into the bottomless pit.",
 "rpg.prologue.N08.zh": "于是撒旦沉入无底坑。",
 "rpg.prologue.N09.en": "Michael rose into heaven; his body faded away, until only a feather remained.",
 "rpg.prologue.N09.en_full": "Michael rose into heaven; his body faded away, until only a feather remained.",
 "rpg.prologue.N09.zh": "米迦勒升到天上，身体渐渐消散，只剩下一片羽毛。",
 "rpg.prologue.R01.en": "Feather of Michael",
 "rpg.prologue.R01.en_full": "Feather of Michael",
 "rpg.prologue.R01.zh": "米迦勒之羽",
 "rpg.prologue.R02.en": "A past like a dream, yet no passing smoke.",
 "rpg.prologue.R02.en_full": "A past like a dream, yet no passing smoke.",
 "rpg.prologue.R02.zh": "虚幻的过往，并非云烟。",
 "rpg.prologue.R03.en": "He shall return.",
 "rpg.prologue.R03.en_full": "He shall return.",
 "rpg.prologue.R03.zh": "祂终将归来。",
